he delta is 11 new `internal/environ` files + LOGBOOK only.\n23|- Story branch synced with `--force-with-lease`; PR #35 head is now\n24|  `1296ecc`, OPEN.\n25|\n26|## Gates re-run directly by this run (no pipes, real exit codes)\n27|\n28|| Gate | Exit |\n29||---|---|\n30|| `go build ./...` | 0 |\n31|| `gofmt -l internal/` (empty) | 0 |\n32|| `go vet ./...` | 0 |\n33|| `GOOS=windows go vet ./...` | 0 |\n34|| `go test ./internal/environ/ -count=1` | 0 |\n35|| `go test ./... -count=1` (19 packages ok) | 0 |\n36|| `go test ./internal/environ/ -race -count=1` | 0 |\n37|| `go test ./internal/environ/ -cover -count=1` (76.1%) | 0 |\n38|| `go run ./internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck` (contracts=60 sections=36 acceptance_cases=94) | 0 |\n39|\n40|## Standing evidence (prior run, unchanged by this run)\n41|\n42|- `TASK-260830-3bkz0c_boundary.md`: 7/7 AC rows driven through named\n43|  production call sites; 4 live divergences ledgered (escaped-backslash\n44|  surrogate split, arm splits, caller-rule equality).\n45|- `TASK-260830-3bkz0c_mutation-log.md`: narrowing 6/6 killed\n46|  (N1/N2/N3/N4/N6 + token-preserving T1); D1 existence-only; 0 survivors.\n47|- Full-repo `-race` not re-run (exceeds one bounded call; prior run raced\n48|  the touched package, re-confirmed above)."}}}
